#: src/iconlib/cmd/main.py:48
msgid ""
"Commands:\n"
"  search [pattern]   list matching icon names\n"
"  which [-a] name    print icon path(s)\n"
"  info name          print icon metadata\n"
"  libraries          list discovered icon libraries\n"
"  pull [pattern]     copy icons into the project\n"
"  push [pattern]     upload icons (not implemented)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   open themestylebrowser\n"
"  index              generate web preview and/or FAISS index\n"
"  delete name...     remove local icon files\n"
"  rename old new     rename local icon files\n"
"  copy from to       copy local icon files\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  link local icon files\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  derive local variants\n"
"\n"
"Pattern: empty=all, exact name, glob, or /regex\n"
"Plain English words also match synonyms/inflections (scored).\n"
"Local commands operate under project-dir/local-dir (default: icons/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Comandos:\n"
"  search [pattern]   listar nombres de iconos coincidentes\n"
"  which [-a] name    mostrar ruta(s) del icono\n"
"  info name          mostrar metadatos del icono\n"
"  libraries          listar bibliotecas descubiertas\n"
"  pull [pattern]     copiar iconos al proyecto\n"
"  push [pattern]     subir iconos (no implementado)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   abrir themestylebrowser\n"
"  index              generar vista web y/o índice FAISS\n"
"  delete name...     eliminar archivos locales de iconos\n"
"  rename old new     renombrar archivos locales\n"
"  copy from to       copiar archivos locales\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  enlazar archivos locales\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  derivar variantes locales\n"
"\n"
"Patrón: vacío=todos, nombre exacto, glob o /regex\n"
"Las palabras inglesas simples también coinciden con sinónimos/flexiones (puntuadas).\n"
"Los comandos locales operan bajo project-dir/local-dir (predeterminado: icons/).\n"

#: src/iconlib/cmd/main.py:72
